    "en": {
      "name": "Ashtraja Susanoo",
      "effect": "1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuners\nIf this card is Synchro Summoned: You can banish any number of Traps from your GY; banish that many cards on the field. During the End Phase: You can target up to 2 \"Ashtra\" monsters and/or \"Ashtra\" Traps in your GY and/or banishment; for each of them, add it to your hand or Set it, then if you targeted 2 cards, return this card to the Extra Deck. You can only use each effect of \"Ashtraja Susanoo\" once per turn.",
      "official": false
    },
